 633:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *      01 <DropCnt><TimeStamp>  Max. packet len is 1 + 5 + 5 = 11
 634:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
