 638:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Return value
 639:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    !=0:  Success, Message sent (stored in RTT-Buffer)
 640:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    ==0:  Buffer full, Message *NOT* stored
 641:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
 642:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
