1026:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
1027:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Stores a character in the printf-buffer and sends the buffer when
1028:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *     it is filled.
1029:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1030:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
