1412:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
1413:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Initializes the SYSVIEW module.
1414:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Must be called before the SystemView Application connects to
1415:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    the system.
1416:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1417:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Parameters
1418:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SysFreq        - Frequency of timestamp, usually CPU core clock frequency.
1419:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    CPUFreq        - CPU core clock frequency.
1420:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pOSAPI         - Pointer to the API structure for OS-specific functions.
1421:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pfSendSysDesc  - Pointer to record system description callback function.
1422:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1423:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1424:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    This function initializes the RTT channel used to transport
1425:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    SEGGER SystemView packets.
1426:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is assigned the label "SysView" for client software
1427:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    to identify the SystemView channel.
1428:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1429:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The channel is configured with the macro SEGGER_SYSVIEW_RTT_CHANNEL.
1430:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
