1818:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
1819:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
1820:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The string is encoded as a count byte followed by the contents
1821:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    of the string.
1822:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    No more than SEGGER_SYSVIEW_MAX_STRING_LEN bytes will be encoded to the payload.
1823:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** */
1824:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** void SEGGER_SYSVIEW_RecordString(unsigned int EventID, const char* pString) {
1825:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c ****   U8* pPayload;
