2139:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
2140:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Format and send an ISR exit event.
2141:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
