2766:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    pPayloadEnd  - Pointer to the end of the payload.
2767:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *                   Make sure there are at least 5 bytes free after the payload.
2768:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    EventId      - Id of the event packet.
2769:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
