2809:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
2810:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Function description
2811:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Encode a string in variable-length format.
2812:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *
