2818:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Return value
2819:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    Pointer to the byte following the value, i.e. the first free
2820:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    byte in the payload and the next position to store payload
