2823:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *  Additional information
2824:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    The string is encoded as a count byte followed by the contents
2825:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    of the string.
2826:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *    No more than 1 + MaxLen bytes will be encoded to the payload.
