2929:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *      pfSendModuleDesc  - Callback function pointer to send more detailed module description to Sy
2930:./trace/SEGGER/SEGGER_SYSVIEW.c **** *      pNext             - Pointer to next registered module. Out parameter, set by this function. 
